# ================================================================================
FIX: SUBMIT REQUEST NOT SETTING PENDING STATUS & NOT TRIGGERING WORKFLOW

## PROBLEM DIAGNOSIS:

When you click SUBMIT button, the request is SAVED but:

1. Status remains ‘DRAFT’ instead of changing to ‘PENDING’
1. Workflow is not triggered
1. No workflow item is created

## ROOT CAUSE:

In ZCL_A2R_WBS_BUILDER->SUBMIT_REQUEST method:

- The method calls SAVE_REQUEST first (which sets status = ‘DRAFT’)
- Then it’s supposed to UPDATE status to ‘PENDING’
- But the UPDATE statement might be executing BEFORE the SAVE commits
- Workflow trigger might be failing silently

